# Luminol light: warm is brighter, cold lasts longer
# Two matched prepared systems differ only in temperature. This is a luminol
# classroom demonstration, not commercial glow-stick chemistry.
register lv2

add v1 luminol_glow_solution 20g
add v1 hydrogen_peroxide_3_percent 5g
cool v1 2kJ

new beaker
add v2 luminol_glow_solution 20g
add v2 hydrogen_peroxide_3_percent 5g
heat v2 2kJ

look v1
look v2
wait 30s
look v1
look v2

# Relative intensity and half-life are an explicitly calibrated,
# Arrhenius-shaped comparison. Products and photon yield are not computed.
